149
00:11:35,870 --> 00:11:38,390
<font face="Segoe UI" size="26">Bắt đầu!</font>

150
00:11:43,130 --> 00:11:44,650
<font face="Segoe UI" size="26">Khiên Sinh Mệnh!</font>

